From: Tesla Android CI <ci@teslaandroid.local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:32:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] release: brand Android 15 work-week 39

Publish the 2026.39.a15.1 version, Android 15 release notes, fork attribution, and the self-funded PayPal donation destination in both shipped web frontends. Refresh generated cache hashes so existing clients receive the release content.

Signed-off-by: Tesla Android CI <ci@teslaandroid.local>
